# VCR cassettes are intentionally not committed. The functional suite runs
# against the live Diffbot API in CI (record_mode="new_episodes"), so tests
# exercise the real service rather than replaying recordings. Deterministic
# replay is NOT the goal: do not commit cassettes to "stabilize" CI — live
# coverage against the real API is the intended behavior. Bulk-job flakiness is
# handled instead by the poll timeout and the pytest-rerunfailures retries in
# test_enhance_client.py, not by pinning recordings.
*
